  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Far from Bai Ning Bing, who is trying to subdue raging wave rising dragon fire, Ying Wu Xie activates the immortal killer move Burning Soul Bursting Luck to raise luck. He has already used Connect Luck Immortal Gu to tie their luck together. He used the same move earlier in Central Continent’s Earth Abyss when trying to refine Fixed Immortal Travel, burning his own soul to spike luck; that refinement still failed because Heavenly Court had already refined the unique Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1212
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "gu_connect_luck",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Western Desert, Ying Wu Xie activates burning soul bursting luck first; his luck rises many times while his soul weakens, and guts Gu restores him even as his soul path dao marks fall sharply. The move expends soul foundation to temporarily increase luck, permanently uses up soul path dao marks, and needs enough of those marks to activate, so on Fang Yuan’s side only he and Ying Wu Xie can cast it. With Ying Wu Xie’s guidance, Fang Yuan succeeds on his first use after two failures; the core is the soul path Immortal Gu Soul Howl. After one cast his soul path dao marks are nearly wiped out, and Ying Wu Xie warns that the same person cannot stack the move repeatedly for more effect. Ying Wu Xie, as Spectral Soul’s split soul, has foundation enough to use it four times.",
      "chapters": [
        1405
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-expenditure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "gu_guts_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_soul_howl_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before entering green ghost desert, Fang Yuan activates burning soul bursting luck himself instead of asking Ying Wu Xie, spending a large share of soul foundation that he can then bear.",
      "chapters": [
        1506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "green-ghost-desert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that killing Ye Fan helps him because, under their main and sub luck link, each use of burning soul bursting luck also gives Ye Fan a portion of that luck.",
      "chapters": [
        1536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "connected-luck-share",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_fan"
      ]
    }
